    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 1 Washington Green is an immaculate four-bedroom end-of-terrace home, ideally positioned within this family-friendly development off Malahide Road in Balgriffin. This spacious and beautifully presented property boasts a superb standard of finish with high-quality fixtures and fittings throughout.\r\n\r\nUpon arrival, you are immediately impressed by the exceptional showhouse condition of this home with feature luxury vinyl tiled herringbone floor throughout. The welcoming entrance hall leads to a bright and spacious lounge featuring a charming bay window, guest WC and a superb open-plan kitchen, dining and family area that boasts a luxurious fitted kitchen with an abundance of storage, feature island unit and double doors opening onto a large sunny south-facing landscaped garden. Upstairs, the property continues to impress with four generous bedrooms, fitted wardrobes and the master bedroom benefiting from a stylish en-suite. A large and well-appointed family bathroom completes the accommodation.\r\n\r\nThis address connects you to it all, conveniently located with the M1 and M50 motorways both just a matter of minutes away. For those who choose public transport, regular buses services Dublin City Centre and beyond, so you can enjoy stress-free daily commutes."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall\t2.8 x 2.54\tLuxury vinyl tiled herringbone floor, security alarm.\r\n\t\t\r\nGuest W.C\t1.52 x 1.47\tTiled floor, holders, wc, whb with tiled backsplash, heated rail\r\n \r\nLounge (into bay)\t4.66 x 6.06\tLuxury Vinyl tiled herringbone floor, large under stair storage, feature wall panelling, spotlights\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Area\t5.45 x 3.64\tLuxury Vinyl tiled herringbone floor, fully fitted kitchen, Electrolux double oven, microwave, fitted units,            Quartz countertops, island, Neff dishwasher, hob, extractor fan, spotlights, Electrolux Larder fridge\r\n\r\nFamily Area\t1.9 x 3.4\tDouble doors to south facing garden, spotlights\r\n\r\nUtility Room\t2.0 x 2.0        Plumbed for washer & dryer, fitted units\r\n \r\nStairs / Landing\t\tAccess to attic, carpet runner, skylight, storage press\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 1\t3.23 x 3.15\tDouble fitted wardrobes\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 2\t2.84 x 4.32\tOne and a half-fitted wardrobe \r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 3\t2.66 x 2.7\t   \r\n\t\t\r\nBathroom\t2.25 x 3.00\tTiled floor & walls, bath suite, separate shower, handheld shower head, accessories, shave light, wc, whb\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom\t3.40 x 4.15\tAbundance of fitted wardrobes\r\n\t\t\r\nEn Suite\t1.86 x 1.7\tTiled floor, wc, whb, walk in shower, cabinet, holders\r\n\t\r\nGarden       Porcelain tiled patio, lawn, sunny south facing aspect, fully walled, raised flower beds"
